","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"w","x":260.0,"y":44.0,"w":64.0,"h":34.0,"text":"&mut\nwrites","tone":"red","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":112.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":160.0,"y2":104.0,"tone":"blue","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":250.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":200.0,"y2":104.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":152.0,"text":"error[E0502]","tone":"red","size":9.5,"mono":true}],[{"t":"cell","id":"c0","x":70.0,"y":44.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"core 0: S","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c1","x":70.0,"y":92.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"core 1: S","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"t","x":70.0,"y":130.0,"text":"both read: Shared","size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d0","x":280.0,"y":44.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"core 0: M","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d1","x":280.0,"y":92.0,"w":90.0,"h":28.0,"text":"core 1: I","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5,"o":0.5},{"t":"text","id":"t2","x":280.0,"y":130.0,"text":"one writes: Modified","size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":128.0,"y1":68.0,"x2":232.0,"y2":54.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[12.1,19.5,35.4]}]},{"title":"Dangling pointer","sub":"Why you cannot push with a live reference","short":"push and a reference","main":"push may move to a new buffer: a reference to the old one would dangle.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Reference to an element","push → realloc","Build error"],"captions":["first points at the first element in the vector's buffer","push ran out of capacity: the allocator gave a new buffer, the elements moved, the old one was freed — first now dangles in the void","Rust does not let this happen: while the reader first is alive, the vector cannot be changed"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":8.0,"y":16.0,"lines":["let mut v = vec![1, 2, 3];","let first = &v[0];"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":16.0,"w":200.0},{"t