unction return? The compiler does not guess and asks you to say so","The name 'a ties both references and the result: the result does not live longer than either argument","There is no annotation at run time — it is a hint for the checker, and only the function signature is checked"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["fn longest(a: &str, b: &str) -> &str {","    if a.len() > b.len() { a } else { b }","}"],"bad":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":17.0,"w":330.0},{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":180.0,"y":130.0,"w":300.0,"h":24.0,"text":"error[E0106]: missing lifetime specifier","tone":"red","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":14.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["fn longest<'a>(a: &'a str, b: &'a str) -> &'a str {","    if a.len() > b.len() { a } else { b }","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":17.0,"w":336.0},{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":120.0,"w":50.0,"h":24.0,"text":"a: 'a","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":150.0,"y":120.0,"w":50.0,"h":24.0,"text":"b: 'a","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"r","x":280.0,"y":120.0,"w":80.0,"h":24.0,"text":"result: 'a","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":90.0,"y1":120.0,"x2":226.0,"y2":120.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"text","id":"t","x":180.0,"y":20.0,"text":"lifetime →","size":9.0},{"t":"text","id":"la","x":24.0,"y":56.0,"text":"a","size":10.0,"mono":true},{"t":"line","id":"ra","x1":40.0,"y1":56.0,"x2":320.0,"y2":56.0,"tone":"blue","width":6.0},{"t":"text","id":"lb","x":24.0,"y":88.0,"text":"b","size":10.0,"mono":true},{"t":"line","id":"rb","x1":40.0,"y1":88.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":88.0,"tone":"blue","width":6.0},{"t":"text","id":"lr","x":18.0,"y":120.0,"text":"res","size":10.0,"mono":true},{"t":"line","id":"rr","x1":40.0,"y1":120.0,"x2":220.0,"y2":120.0,"tone":"green","width":6.0},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":152.0,"text":"the result does not live longer than the shortest argument","size":9.